<template><section class="pro-panel"><div class="td-wallet-head"><div><span class="eyebrow">Tipster earnings</span><h1>Earnings & Revenue</h1><p>Rewards come from BraTipsters subscription revenue. This is not a user betting wallet. Withdrawals are reviewed and paid manually.</p></div><span class="td-wallet-badge">{{wallet?.settings?.tipsterPoolPercent||30}}% TIPSTER POOL</span></div><div class="td-wallet-grid"><div><small>Available</small><strong>{{formatMoney(wallet?.wallet?.availableBalance)}}</strong><span>Eligible for withdrawal</span></div><div><small>Pending</small><strong>{{formatMoney(wallet?.wallet?.pendingBalance)}}</strong><span>Under review</span></div><div><small>Lifetime earned</small><strong>{{formatMoney(wallet?.wallet?.lifetimeEarned)}}</strong><span>Performance rewards</span></div><div><small>Withdrawn</small><strong>{{formatMoney(wallet?.wallet?.lifetimeWithdrawn)}}</strong><span>Completed payouts</span></div></div><div class="td-wallet-actions"><div><b>How rewards work</b><span>At month end, {{wallet?.settings?.tipsterPoolPercent||30}}% of collected subscription revenue is distributed to eligible tipsters using the published performance formula.</span></div><RouterLink to="/tipster-dashboard/withdrawals" class="btn">Request withdrawal →</RouterLink></div></section></template>
<script setup lang="ts">import{onMounted,ref}from'vue';import{RouterLink}from'vue-router';import{api}from'../services/api';import{formatMoney}from'../utils/formatters';const wallet=ref<any>(null);onMounted(async()=>{try{wallet.value=(await api.get('/me/tipster/wallet')).data}catch{}})</script>
